# procedural-chart
# State chart: pi calls a tool over the gateway MCP route and the gateway journal agrees (#28). Throwaway MCP server and gateway on loopback.
direction: down
title: "pi tool call over the gateway MCP route" {shape: text}

idle: Nothing running {shape: oval}
configured: pi configured with only the gateway MCP URL (pi mcp add)
called: pi called the tool with the canary argument
agreed: Gateway journal matches pi's record

idle -> configured: "cmd: just pi-mcp-check | pass: prints 'pi mcp list: rc=0 tools=[...alpha_ping...]'"
configured -> called: "cmd: just pi-mcp-check | pass: prints 'pi: tool_calls=1 args={message: canary-...} received_pong=True'"
called -> agreed: "cmd: just pi-mcp-check | pass: prints 'gateway: tools/call records=1 tool=[alpha_ping] arguments=[{...canary...}]'"
agreed -> idle: "cmd: just pi-mcp-check | pass: prints 'PASS pi-mcp' and podman ps -a lists no wattson-gw-pimcp"
